Cell["\<\
The lattice points of the ball of radius 3 of the grid, with disks of radius \
0.5 and 0.75. At 0.5 the disks meet along the edges of the grid; at 0.75 the \
four disks at the corners of each square meet, and the complex fills the \
diamond:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"81cd58af-d56b-4b2f-8499-08abc07d9c34"],

